### AI Fabric Runtime — local smoke requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8097
@trustedBackendApiKey = change-me
@userId = user-1
@sessionId = user-1-session
@conversationId = chat-user-1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Swagger UI (open in browser)
# {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui/index.html

### Chat: query using verified auth context (preferred secure contract)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-AIFABRIC-RUNTIME-API-KEY: {{trustedBackendApiKey}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-ID: {{userId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-TYPE: END_USER
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-MODE: PRIVATE_RUNTIME_BACKEND_MEDIATED
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-CALLER-TYPE: TRUSTED_BACKEND
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SESSION-ID: {{sessionId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-ISSUER: runtime.http

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "query": "What can you do?"
}

### Chat: suggestions using verified auth context
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json
X-AIFABRIC-RUNTIME-API-KEY: {{trustedBackendApiKey}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-ID: {{userId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-TYPE: END_USER
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-MODE: PRIVATE_RUNTIME_BACKEND_MEDIATED
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-CALLER-TYPE: TRUSTED_BACKEND
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SESSION-ID: {{sessionId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-ISSUER: runtime.http

{
  "content": "I want to search my docs",
  "maxSuggestions": 5
}

### Conversations using verified auth context (requires ai.chat.enabled=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations
X-AIFABRIC-RUNTIME-API-KEY: {{trustedBackendApiKey}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-ID: {{userId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-TYPE: END_USER
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-MODE: PRIVATE_RUNTIME_BACKEND_MEDIATED
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-CALLER-TYPE: TRUSTED_BACKEND
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SESSION-ID: {{sessionId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-ISSUER: runtime.http

### Conversation detail using verified auth context
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}
X-AIFABRIC-RUNTIME-API-KEY: {{trustedBackendApiKey}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-ID: {{userId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-TYPE: END_USER
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-MODE: PRIVATE_RUNTIME_BACKEND_MEDIATED
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-CALLER-TYPE: TRUSTED_BACKEND
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SESSION-ID: {{sessionId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-ISSUER: runtime.http

### Delete conversation using verified auth context
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}
X-AIFABRIC-RUNTIME-API-KEY: {{trustedBackendApiKey}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-ID: {{userId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SUBJECT-TYPE: END_USER
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-MODE: PRIVATE_RUNTIME_BACKEND_MEDIATED
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-CALLER-TYPE: TRUSTED_BACKEND
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-SESSION-ID: {{sessionId}}
X-AIFABRIC-AUTH-ISSUER: runtime.http

### Legacy compatibility chat query (migration-only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "query": "What can you do?"
}

### Legacy compatibility conversations (migration-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations?ownerId={{userId}}

### Data Sync: list vector spaces (requires embeddings enabled + data sync enabled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/data-sync/vector-spaces

### Data Sync: upsert a document into vector space "document"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/data-sync/upsert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vectorSpace": "document",
  "id": "doc-1",
  "content": "Return policy: returns accepted within 30 days with receipt.",
  "metadata": { "source": "runtime.http" },
  "trace": { "requestId": "req-1", "userId": "{{userId}}", "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}" }
}
